# The build context of cmd/cacheservice/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads the ignore
# file next to the Dockerfile, not the root's). The context is the repository
# root; this keeps it to the packages cmd/cacheservice builds from:
#
#   go list -deps ./cmd/cacheservice | grep ^github.com/dagger/dagger/
#
# plus sdk/go, which go.mod replaces dagger.io/dagger with. If the service
# starts importing a package outside these directories, add it here: the
# image build then fails with "no required module provides package".
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/cacheservice
!dagql
!engine
!internal
!sdk/go
!util
# Not needed to build the binary.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata
cmd/cacheservice/e2e
cmd/cacheservice/Dockerfile*
**/*.md
